# Sound assets directory for RustRide audio engine
#
# Place WAV or MP3 sound files here. The audio backend will load
# them by name (without extension).
#
# Expected sounds:
# - countdown_tick.wav - Short tick for countdown timers
# - interval_change.wav - Sound for workout interval changes
# - achievement_bronze.wav - Bronze achievement unlocked
# - achievement_silver.wav - Silver achievement unlocked
# - achievement_gold.wav - Gold achievement unlocked
# - workout_start.wav - Workout session starting
# - workout_complete.wav - Workout completed
#
# If audio files are missing, the audio engine will fall back to
# generated tones.
